"brand_book", "section_id": "33bb5a4c-1bc7-4deb-9837-fc2b82a09da8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.2", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:507b9731-f05a-4b8f-a888-c86b043fce40"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:32bd715c-cf39-431e-9310-aaf5b8a5ece9", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Campaign Visual", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 39, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "32bd715c-cf39-431e-9310-aaf5b8a5ece9", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The campaign visual works to clearly communicate the slowing of disease progression with OFEV ® . The campaign shows a declining path, which represents the continuous and irreversible deterioration of lung function in patients with IPF. The path is changed by the intervention of the hand, which lifts and supports the patient as he enjoys time with his grandson, an activity that is common, but not always possible for many patients with IPF. The hand that is changing the path can be interpreted as the HCP, OFEV ® , or Boehringer Ingelheim.\n\nTogether, the downward angle of the path, in contrast with the angle of the inset image of the patient, represents the reduction in lung function decline and the slowing of disease progression with OFEV ® .\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:110d7b54-4801-484e-917f-2e61fe1db01f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:4d71ac10-b21b-4158-8cc7-cb4ab975a68a", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "4d71ac10-b21b-4158-8cc7-cb4ab975a68a", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.3", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:ddbb59a3-2a92-415f-845e-5c2549210e23"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:867e2dbb-dff0-4a67-a359-bd8580ba9d15", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Image Library", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "867e2dbb-dff0-4a67-a359-bd8580ba9d15", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Several additional visuals are available to provide variety within a consistent campaign style. Each image has been carefully chosen to show patients with IPF engaging in activities that are both credible and compelling for this population.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:6ae061b2-a2e9-4e6f-b23c-f7143c5cfb33"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:aedd0ddd-2309-405b-9b27-36237e738956", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Direction for conducting localised green screen photoshoot", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 40, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "aedd0ddd-2309-405b-9b27-36237e738956", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "In the event that there is a need to use a different patient type or activity level within the context of this background imagery, new photography can be retouched into the existing backgrounds. Here are some general guidelines for photography if this need arises.\n\n1.  Studio: Talent may be photographed against a plain, white, seamless background\n2. Camera: Use a medium format camera with an 80 mm lens\n3. Camera position: Set camera 12 to 13 feet from subject, approximately at height of subject's waist\n4. Lighting: To match lighting conditions of the backgrounds, use a hard light high up on camera left to emulate sunlight and a fill light lower on camera right\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:accaf163-7520-4085-be27-448ee29fe1ce"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:cc82e77f-f0fa-47d3-b505-0ccc98541cdd", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "4.4", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 41, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "cc82e77f-f0fa-47d3-b505-0ccc98541cdd", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d89b2866-1a7e-4aa3-b16e-387715043740", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Patient Imagery", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 41, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d89b2866-1a7e-4aa3-b16e-387715043740", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The patients depicted in the existing campaign have been photographed in a neutral setting to provide additional flexibility and utility throughout multiple communication platforms.\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e8a52d2d-8491-4b3f-ab5c-8ce44f6b45b5"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:24d51b98-3ba5-427e-9faf-cdbc76911bdf", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "24d51b98-3ba5-427e-9faf-cdbc76911bdf", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.5", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:11f62564-92f6-456c-815b-ec0b014e5a80"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:f6ac55d4-b4ca-4a20-b5dd-9c93c1cf6592", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Campaign Headline", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "f6ac55d4-b4ca-4a20-b5dd-9c93c1cf6592", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The campaign headline speaks directly to changing the decline in lung function to slow disease progression in IPF. It also serves as a strong call to action for HCPs. For too long, HCPs have felt helpless but now they have the power to change lives with OFEV ® , a long-awaited treatment for IPF.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:39d35ebc-1412-49a6-9966-3ae2245925c5"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:b241179e-edbf-4f4f-861e-2149c9866f4b", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "CHANGE THE PATH OF IPF", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 42, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b241179e-edbf-4f4f-861e-2149c9866f4b", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:58c3447a-de35-4532-ab2c-19f42c3fcf5d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 43, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "58c3447a-de35-4532-ab2c-19f42c3fcf5d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.6", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:4fedb438-18b3-4315-ad8c-2d6631c4ed73"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:987fcd3a-20a6-4b32-a78d-f3375ed2e2ae", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Tagline", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 43, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "987fcd3a-20a6-4b32-a78d-f3375ed2e2ae", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "[TAGLINE AND EXPLANATION TO COME]", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:c9aec2c7-2d76-4aa9-a07f-f5b7204aaca8"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d92a90eb-3eea-4d08-96e4-42b4d6468f13", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "[taglIne to come]", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 43, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d92a90eb-3eea-4d08-96e4-42b4d6468f13", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:6ae54a37-3dad-4415-8357-b6333f737967", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 44, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "6ae54a37-3dad-4415-8357-b6333f737967", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.7", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:10ec3411-03d1-4ba8-a8c8-fe3a8f512986"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:bda01afe-dea7-4e12-833e-f18770366c7f", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Campaign Examples", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 44, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "bda01afe-dea7-4e12-833e-f18770366c7f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The campaign should be applied to all types of tactics and communications in a cohesive and consistent manner. Here are some examples of the campaign integrated into approved tactics.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ncAMPAiGn BAnnEr\n\noFEV ®  LEAVE-BEHind BrocHurE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\noFEV ®  LAuncH MAStEr intErActiVE ViSuAL Aid\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:668cfa0b-445d-4344-9127-cedba23e079b"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:723ccf11-8c83-43dc-9481-8869bcded374", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "4.8", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 45, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "723ccf11-8c83-43dc-9481-8869bcded374", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:46e31506-ef1c-41da-aec2-d7ac6ad7f869", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Message Flow: Disease State", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 45, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "46e31506-ef1c-41da-aec2-d7ac6ad7f869", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The development of the core story flow was validated by market research. Beginning with disease state messages grounds the HCP in the severity of IPF. FVC decline in patients with IPF is highlighted to emphasize the need for a treatment to slow IPF progression and help transition to the branded story.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:48b92d6d-7566-4b23-9956-f6359d76b471"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:8a05aa6f-e286-4141-81e2-4a4e4144ff57", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 46, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "8a05aa6f-e286-4141-81e2-4a4e4144ff57", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "4.9", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7d553e24-3d5a-4c6f-a337-8e7b49ba7d39"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Message Flow: Branded", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 46, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "2dab5132-5c3e-4be8-b6d9-e55b83b2a72d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The branded message flow is focused on the core selling messages for OFEV ® :\n\n-  OFEV ®  slows disease progression in a broad range of IPF patient types with a 50% reduction in the decline of lung function\n- Also including patients with early disease (FVC &gt;90% predicted), no honeycombing on HRCT, and concomitant emphysema\n-  Only OFEV ®  reduces adjudicated acute exacerbations by 68%\n-  Side effects can be effectively managed in most patients\n-  Only 1 capsule, twice daily, ensures ease of dosing\n\nThese messages communicate the brand benefit and were the most motivating to the HCP audience during market research.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7fac62a8-c282-486d-bba6-0ebc79891255"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:e32acba0-ec26-47cd-b571-53df947ba922", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "cHAnGE tHE PAtH oF iPF", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 46, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "e32acba0-ec26-47cd-b571-53df947ba922", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "ProVidE Your PAtiEntS WitH A tArGEtEd trEAtMEnt SHoWn to SLoW iPF diSEASE ProGrESSion\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e1e49948-e5ee-4671-9e5f-2c4070bad995"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:f779044f-d634-404c-8311-d27051044e23", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 47, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "f779044f-d634-404c-8311-d27051044e23", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n4.10", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:f4e71106-1316-48ef-9806-31d5af389546"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:7c72b4cd-3c5c-40e4-81b8-b27c979e99b3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "HCP Core Campaign Summary", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 47, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "7c72b4cd-3c5c-40e4-81b8-b27c979e99b3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:10a04b84-85c9-48d4-9d94-903c39a8edcb"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d26d7518-667f-4320-9f6e-98610a83034d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "change the Path of IPf", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 47, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d26d7518-667f-4320-9f6e-98610a83034d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:64027209-8f34-4e8a-babf-6709a6192145"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:621fb49b-8aa0-4741-9dac-5bee1399db07", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Patient Branded Identity System 5.0", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 48, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "621fb49b-8aa0-4741-9dac-5bee1399db07", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The patient branded identity system comprises key assets that are designed, managed, and used in a recognizable way across all of our branded materials that are patient facing.\n\nOur identity system unifies our patient branded materials in a consistent, flexible, and ownable way across all channels, allowing us to communicate consistently with patients with IPF and their caregivers.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:c6dc7ec6-2086-4986-954a-44f6cef154b5"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:91ee5f74-2f38-4c9e-bb11-b1e19c994759", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "91ee5f74-2f38-4c9e-bb11-b1e19c994759", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "1\n\n.\n\n5", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:6af52968-8b22-4503-b9a5-d754a81b167f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:e6a72876-6094-47c5-9b6d-134c615c6905", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Patient Branded Identity System Summary", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 57, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "e6a72876-6094-47c5-9b6d-134c615c6905", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "iLLuStrAtionS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nLinE PAttErn\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nHoLdinG SHAPE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPAtiEnt BrocHurE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ndoSinG rEMindEr MAGnEt\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ncoLor PALEttE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\ncArEGiVEr BrocHurE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMEdicinE rEcord cArd\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:5c41a703-4391-43f8-9da4-cdebe8cddc73"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d4446dc7-f9ad-430a-b635-6f0399220be6", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Typography", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d4446dc7-f9ad-430a-b635-6f0399220be6", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Typography is another important element of our brand identity and a way to express our personality. The OFEV ®  primary fonts are Co Text Bold and Co Text Light. Co Text complements the visual elements seen in the OFEV ®  symbol and is also the font that the OFEV ®  logotype is based on. The OFEV ®  secondary font, used for body copy, is the Gotham Family, including Gotham Book, Gotham Bold, and Gotham Italic.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\naa", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:22dede4a-74b0-47f6-a8b2-d43a570a9c0d"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:f308d1d2-74fa-4d1f-8f66-4b82f1dc5c83", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Headlines should be Co Text Bold sentence case", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "f308d1d2-74fa-4d1f-8f66-4b82f1dc5c83", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:16696d3d-a449-4098-9387-26b4cf6e2ca8", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "SUBHEADS SHOULD BE CO TEXT BOLD ALL CAPS", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "16696d3d-a449-4098-9387-26b4cf6e2ca8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Body copy should be Gotham Book sentence case in 80%K. Body call-outs should be in Gotham Bold.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e6f2dec9-75f8-4836-b8cf-44d54e7a38ac"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:88e52763-99f8-45a6-9df0-ecb35ca9323e", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "hcP core campaign 4.0", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 37, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "88e52763-99f8-45a6-9df0-ecb35ca9323e", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The core campaign is the way in which the key brand benefit and the overall brand essence are expressed, both functionally and emotionally. By utilizing the brand's core attributes, the campaign conveys the reason to believe in OFEV ® and communicates the tangible patient benefit to healthcare professionals (HCPs).", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:062fb8aa-bfd1-4565-81e3-ed69ae095dbf"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:edc8cef2-9f8f-47c4-908e-7208aa6fed11", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "How the Campaign Elements Work Together", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 38, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "edc8cef2-9f8f-47c4-908e-7208aa6fed11", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The key elements of the campaign-the visual, headline, tagline, and secondary graphics-are all designed to reinforce the idea that OFEV ®  slows disease progression. All the elements complement one another and work synergistically to communicate the key brand benefit in a clear and compelling way.\n\nA\n\nI\n\nG\n\nN\n\nO\n\nR\n\nE\n\nA\n\nM\n\nH\n\nC\n\nP\n\nO\n\nF\n\nE\n\nV\n\nA\n\nB\n\n)\n\nR\n\nY\n\nG\n\nU\n\nL\n\nS\n\n(\n\nN\n\nI\n\nT\n\nE\n\nD\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n.\n\nY\n\nR\n\nU\n\nS\n\nO\n\nN\n\nF\n\nI\n\nD\n\nE\n\nT\n\nA\n\nL\n\n.\n\nC", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:7809cec7-e3fc-419f-845b-bddff06aacb6"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:0f07a5a0-b4ac-4840-948d-d9da55a32b72", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Call-outs should be Co Text Light sentence case", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 49, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "0f07a5a0-b4ac-4840-948d-d9da55a32b72", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:a88fb209-bc50-4c9a-aad0-f4f75909cceb", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "5.2", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 50, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "a88fb209-bc50-4c9a-aad0-f4f75909cceb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:69ec0469-c89b-43f1-90a3-4f16e7c33fdf", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "HCP Branded Identity System Summary", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 36, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "69ec0469-c89b-43f1-90a3-4f16e7c33fdf", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "noW APProVEd Ad\n\nMonoGrAPH coVEr\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPoWErPoint: ProMotionAL And cLinicAL\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nBAnnErS\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nFoLdEr\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:9f15db89-4b44-47cb-8615-11e28abd5f28"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:8c93e117-6515-4c2d-9dcf-2cfcba6f6bd2", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Color Palette", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 50, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "8c93e117-6515-4c2d-9dcf-2cfcba6f6bd2", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The OFEV ®  colors were selected to reinforce our brand identity and to differentiate our brand from competitors. They should be used to help maintain brand recognition and impact. The OFEV ®  core brand color is Guardian Blue, and it should be the most prominent color in the palette. In addition, Guardian Blue is the only color that should be used with the line pattern.\n\nThe three secondary colors, Inspiring Yellow, Brilliant Gold, and Premium Orange, reflect the colors used in the OFEV ®  gradient. Premium Orange may be used for highlights in applications as well as in typographical call-outs and subheads.\n\nComfort Gray is included as a neutral tertiary color that helps balance the palette. Comfort Gray can be used in clinical and scientific situations, such as in charts or to represent placebo.\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:86506077-f95b-429a-a25d-16c9ad995fde"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:c8fcd7fa-545a-4194-bf3c-3872a257cb9f", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 36, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "c8fcd7fa-545a-4194-bf3c-3872a257cb9f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "8\n\n.\n\n3\n\nO\n\nF\n\nE\n\nV", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e1d975f1-5071-4d5e-99d0-0566ec506aec"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:6b6d27b0-51e0-42a4-b002-6778a38ceef6", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 51, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "6b6d27b0-51e0-42a4-b002-6778a38ceef6", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "5.3", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:64d7bef9-1954-4573-a53c-224b76707b04"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:1640406f-f8c4-447b-882c-e4a4cec094ec", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Secondary Graphics: Line Pattern", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 51, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "1640406f-f8c4-447b-882c-e4a4cec094ec", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "A line pattern inspired by the core campaign has been incorporated into the Guardian Blue shape in our secondary graphic. This line pattern should only appear within the Guardian Blue shape.\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:399cb407-292b-4746-86c9-b6206fd507cb"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:93782d47-3f7e-4769-bb71-bfd21c826936", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "4.1", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 38, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "93782d47-3f7e-4769-bb71-bfd21c826936", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:7fc2cfd9-dbf1-4f03-bf8f-b4470d4839c8", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 52, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "7fc2cfd9-dbf1-4f03-bf8f-b4470d4839c8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "5.4", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:1bfbabfb-0241-4162-9be3-35b0b1f31582"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:8f9fab1a-35e6-43b3-843e-5b3a34ea2d29", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Secondary Graphics: Holding Shape", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 52, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "8f9fab1a-35e6-43b3-843e-5b3a34ea2d29", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The OFEV ®  holding shape provides yet another distinctive element to the brand's marketing materials. Available in horizontal and vertical formats, the holding shape can be easily scaled to fit any piece. It is designed to be consistent yet flexible for various types of content. When adjusting the size of the holding shape, be sure to scale all the pieces proportionally.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nBAcKGround: 20% PMS 121\n\n45\n\n°", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:a0d22669-3f99-405c-b817-e22ef3cb1506"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:b0f94789-5e86-43d5-a860-79e375fd13dc", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "5.5", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 53, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "b0f94789-5e86-43d5-a860-79e375fd13dc", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:0515c6e0-18d1-492f-8f21-1f0c5945626b", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Secondary Graphics: Illustration Style", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 53, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "0515c6e0-18d1-492f-8f21-1f0c5945626b", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The illustrations work to support the scientific content, while bringing a sense of warmth and approachability. The simple and iconic shapes were designed in a specific style to fit the brand personality.\n\nThe illustrations have a wide range of use and can be used as a cluster or to connect areas of content.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:41ba0a0a-ed5b-4d97-93f2-fa3db8f8fd31"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:bebda097-366f-45f0-8acb-56d98d814ffb", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 57, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "bebda097-366f-45f0-8acb-56d98d814ffb", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "8\n\n.\n\n5", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:238472de-76d9-426b-995a-77d1baf7a2bd"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:17facb3a-8dad-47e4-a49a-802e9a9a3e7f", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 54, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "17facb3a-8dad-47e4-a49a-802e9a9a3e7f", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "6\n\n.\n\n5", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:a8dcc836-a470-429c-b447-f24888f8e0b7"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:38252ec6-7815-4802-b76b-a5669c4f5de3", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "How Our Brand Identity Assets Work T ogether", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 54, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "38252ec6-7815-4802-b76b-a5669c4f5de3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Assets such as typeface, color, and graphics together form our brand identity system, through which we achieve our unique look and feel. All of these elements were created to work together harmoniously and reffect the oFEV ®  brand personality.\n\nPAtiEnt BrocHurE coVEr ExAMPLE\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:b39c0e0b-0a12-414f-8d77-4efbdd5d8798"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:ea88accb-a98a-4d75-8f2a-6075f408f9f8", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 55, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "ea88accb-a98a-4d75-8f2a-6075f408f9f8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "e\n\nr\n\ns\n\ni\n\no\n\nn\n\n3\n\n6\n\n.\n\nV\n\n5\n\nT\n\nP\n\nA\n\nT\n\nI\n\nE\n\nN\n\nB\n\nR\n\nA\n\nD\n\nY\n\nS\n\nS\n\nE\n\nM", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:56be3a20-6647-4a16-8f02-94d603dfbd09"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:134eced7-69bc-4d02-b4e2-5ebf9faf15f8", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 38, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "134eced7-69bc-4d02-b4e2-5ebf9faf15f8", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "e\n\nr\n\ns\n\ni\n\no\n\nn\n\n3\n\n1\n\n5\n\ny\n\n2\n\n0\n\nu\n\ne\n\nd\n\nM\n\na\n\nV\n\nI\n\ns", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:f93cab7e-9166-4bd0-909e-1b15abce52a9"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:81091856-2b4e-44c4-8ea1-a0ee1f5aa01d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "How Our Brand Identity Assets Work T ogether (cont'd)", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 55, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "81091856-2b4e-44c4-8ea1-a0ee1f5aa01d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "PAtiEnt BrocHurE intErior SPrEAd ExAMPLE\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n.\n\nY\n\nR\n\nU\n\nS\n\nO\n\nN\n\nF\n\nI\n\nD\n\nE\n\nT\n\nA\n\nL\n\n.\n\nC", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:c5df3ab7-9d8d-4306-acc0-0b633f72cb18"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d38a1764-b243-42e2-82b5-30a951a2ef13", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "5.7", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 56, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d38a1764-b243-42e2-82b5-30a951a2ef13", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d0e2e3e6-2ebe-4713-b6f8-d24ba5da6d07", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Market-Specific Adaptations", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 56, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d0e2e3e6-2ebe-4713-b6f8-d24ba5da6d07", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "In some markets, local regulatory requirements may influence the design of promotional materials. Some countries may have restrictions on the use of patient photography or the use of brand colors. This page provides examples of how the patient brand assets may be adapted within our system.\n\nRegardless of the use of patient photography or brand colors, designs are unified by the use of key branding elements.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPAtiEnt MAtEriAL WitH PHotoGrAPHY\n\nthis is the preferred design. it should be used in countries that have no restrictions on the use of promotional branding assets. the design is consistent with the HcP branding and may incorporate the logo, branding colors, holding shape, line pattern, illustrations, and patient photography.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPAtiEnt MAtEriAL WitH PHotoGrAPHY And ALtErnAtE coLor PALEttE\n\nthis branding option should be used in countries that cannot use brand colors but can use patient photography. the design includes the holding shape, line pattern, and patient photography.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPAtiEnt MAtEriAL WitHout PHotoGrAPHY\n\nthis is the preferred design for markets that are\n\nnot permitted to use photography. the design is consistent with the HcP branding and may incorporate the logo, branding colors, holding shape, line pattern, and illustrations.\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nPAtiEnt MAtEriAL WitHout PHotoGrAPHY And WitH ALtErnAtE coLor PALEttE\n\nthis option should be used in countries that have restrictions on the use of both patient photography and branding colors. it may incorporate the holding shape and line pattern.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:b30f2487-74a8-45e9-b161-580c04ff247f"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:d28cae55-bd0a-4dc8-8c4a-298c1b3342ac"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:681f4c2c-8132-4a89-b73f-4ee7735ddb85", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "General information about the safe and effective use of OFEV.", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 32, "source_document_type": "prescribing_information", "section_id": "681f4c2c-8132-4a89-b73f-4ee7735ddb85", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_PI.pdf", "source_document_id": "c0db5dd8-583e-47bb-9b75-58402a32791c", "text": "Medicines are sometimes prescribed for purposes other than those listed in a Patient Information leaflet. Do not use OFEV for a condition for which it was not prescribed. Do not give OFEV to other people, even if they have the same symptoms you have. It may harm them. This Patient Information leaflet summarizes the most important information about OFEV. If you would like more information, talk to your doctor. You can ask your pharmacist or doctor for information about OFEV that is written for health professionals.\n\nFor more information about OFEV, including the current prescribing information, and patient support, go to www.ofev.com/support or call Boehringer Ingelheim Pharmaceuticals, Inc. at 1-800-542-6257, or scan the code to go to www.ofev.com/support .\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:2838d889-7657-4f9b-a72c-6ea3fea5668b"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:89d416b6-d59e-4b4b-94e0-934ec14c5503", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "89d416b6-d59e-4b4b-94e0-934ec14c5503", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "<!-- image -->\n\n© Boehringer Ingelheim International GmbH. All rights reserved. May 2015\n\nVersion 3 Issued May 2015\n\n<!-- image -->", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:d91a1e97-6046-448e-8688-4cdf2d53d292"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:210dde9a-f329-4961-b887-708f22d37282", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Brand Identity Guidelines", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 1, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "210dde9a-f329-4961-b887-708f22d37282", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:87911271-cc4f-4d91-a555-6f6d772c046d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Introduction", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 2, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "87911271-cc4f-4d91-a555-6f6d772c046d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "this brand book is a valuable resource that will help you launch an effective brand campaign for oFEV ®  in your region. it provides you with essential guidance on how to build and maintain an identifiable, successful, and consistent global brand.\n\nit is critical to the brand integrity of oFEV ® that these guidelines are closely followed; doing so will ensure that a strong identity is built. As always, please keep in mind that all promotional materials must be reviewed by your local regulatory team for consistency with the local Summary of Product characteristics and Patient information Leaflet and approved by the respective market and prepare for medical, legal, and regulatory review.\n\nEffective global branding establishes a product that is recognized around the world. Key elements, known as brand assets (including brand colors, logo, messages, and promotional concept), build an image that is distinct, repeatable, and translatableregardless of location. The way to achieve high brand recognition is through consistent communication of all branding elements.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:c4bee6d2-48ec-4fae-ba4f-15fea4bc040f"}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:f0ae57b5-78cc-4967-abc4-f3e57482ca9f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:c05a1067-a6ed-419e-8515-560c23e70d54", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_type": "body", "page_number": 3, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "c05a1067-a6ed-419e-8515-560c23e70d54", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "| BRAND                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         | HCP                                                                          |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             