, "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Secondary Graphics File Nomenclature", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 97, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "c07bdef2-34fe-4037-930a-3599822a99c3", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The following nomenclature system has been developed to help identify and easily locate the various graphic files. Please always use the downloadable electronic reproducible art we have provided.\n\nThe various file formats available are: AI (Adobe Illustrator) files are used for all high-quality printing. These files are in a vector format and can be scaled up or down without loss of quality.\n\nJPG (Joint Photographic Experts Group) files are in a compressed format best used on the Internet because they are in RGB. They cannot be scaled up without loss of quality.\n\nPNG (Portable Network Graphics) files are used for importing artwork into PowerPoint for on-screen presentations. These files can also be used on the Internet. This is a compressed format; files are best created at full size and not scaled up or down. PNG files are created with a transparent background.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:9e9ff880-5bc4-49ff-8266-1833e1c89ffe"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:07c107b7-28c6-437e-ba82-b496cb5d802c", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "oFEV\\_SG\\_H\\_cMYK.eps", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 97, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "07c107b7-28c6-437e-ba82-b496cb5d802c", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Product Name\n\nOFEV OFEV ®  (nintedanib)\n\n| Type of Asset SG Secondary Graphic   | Horizontal/ Vertical H Horizontal Format V Vertical Format   | Color Mode CMYK 4-Color Process PMS Pantone Spot Color RGB Digital Publishing   | Extension .ai   |\n|--------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------|\n\nSEcondArY GrAPHic", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e91430a6-eb30-41f0-89fc-fcd3f6c86e4f"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:e9b09a7a-74e1-4fd8-bdd6-71e2eb68a818", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Line Pattern", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 97, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "e9b09a7a-74e1-4fd8-bdd6-71e2eb68a818", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "oFEV\\_SG\\_PAttErn\\_V\\_PMS.ai oFEV\\_SG\\_PAttErn\\_V\\_cMYK.ai oFEV\\_SG\\_PAttErn\\_V\\_rGB.ai", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:e8ce8f1d-0677-4f27-8ed7-f4ec30106177"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:671b8dc5-1b34-4f10-8694-5039942ab59d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Templates", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 97, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "671b8dc5-1b34-4f10-8694-5039942ab59d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "oFEV\\_SG\\_H\\_cMYK.ai oFEV\\_SG\\_V\\_rGB.ai", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:419a1977-eeea-4820-9bc4-cd9b2d948c8e"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:d1410edb-3279-4191-a03b-6e26e730314d", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "9.4", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 98, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "d1410edb-3279-4191-a03b-6e26e730314d", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": ""}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:82a26947-5b97-41bb-a052-8ef1dcf57a12", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "Clinical T rial Logo Nomenclature", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 98, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "82a26947-5b97-41bb-a052-8ef1dcf57a12", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "The following nomenclature system has been developed to help identify and easily locate the various graphic files. Please always use the downloadable electronic reproducible art we have provided.\n\nThe various file formats available are: AI (Adobe Illustrator) files are used for all high-quality printing. These files are in a vector format and can be scaled up or down without loss of quality.\n\nJPG (Joint Photographic Experts Group) files are in a compressed format best used on the Internet because they are in RGB. They cannot be scaled up without loss of quality.\n\nPNG (Portable Network Graphics) files are used for importing artwork into PowerPoint for on-screen presentations. These files can also be used on the Internet. This is a compressed format; files are best created at full size and not scaled up or down. PNG files are created with a transparent background.", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chunk:b2f76536-feb1-4c57-b7a8-56cced026375"}]}, {"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:section:7f29433f-fcd4-4f64-92bf-4e587d790b70", "@type": "Section", "graphScope": "brand", "section_title": "clinical\\_trial\\_Brandid\\_inpulsis\\_1\\_cMYK.eps", "section_type": "heading", "page_number": 98, "source_document_type": "brand_book", "section_id": "7f29433f-fcd4-4f64-92bf-4e587d790b70", "extraction_method": "docling", "source_file_name": "OFEV_Brand-Book_Nov-2015.pdf", "source_document_id": "7c99d579-1450-4667-9bc5-7d13421ddab2", "text": "Product Name\n\nClinical Trial\n\nLoGoS", "SECTION_HAS_CHUNK": [{"@id": "urn:kg:ofev:chun